=======

musl libc (MIT)
---------------

Project:  musl libc, https://musl.libc.org/ (git: https://git.musl-libc.org/cgit/musl)
Ported:   crates/ep9_math/src/fmod.rs (JS `%`, H36), from src/math/fmod.c at tag
          v1.2.6 (9fa28ece75d8a2191de7c5bb53bed224c5947417). The file has not
          changed since ee2ee92d62c4 (2013-09-05); the port matches it line for line
          except that the NaN case returns f64::NAN (M0 week 4).
          The SoftFma code in crates/ep9_math/src/exact.rs also has musl origin
          (src/math/fma.c), through libm (next entry).
Copyright: musl's COPYRIGHT file. fmod.c and fma.c carry no other notice.

