Planned entries (added by the PR that ports the code; not in the tree yet)
==========================================================================

- V8 (BSD-3-Clause): irregexp (RX1), fixed-dtoa, bignum-dtoa,
  DoubleToRadixCString, src/bigint, Torque MathHypot (H36).
- fdlibm (Sun notice "provided that this notice is preserved"), if any
  fdlibm-derived file is ported.
- pxfm 0.1.30 (BSD-3-Clause OR Apache-2.0; ep9 takes the BSD-3-Clause side):
  seed of the correctly rounded functions in crates/ep9_math (H36).
- CORE-MATH (MIT): algorithms of the correctly rounded functions (H36), named
  as the origin where a ported function matches the CORE-MATH C source.
- LLVM libc (Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception): where a ported function comes
  from it (H36).
- ecmascript_atomics (MPL-2.0), only if vendored: the files stay separate,
  keep their MPL header, and binary releases make those files' source
  available.
